graph LR
    MLflow["MLflow Server<br/>v3.14.0"]

    %% External Dependencies (Required)
    MLflow -->|"runtime<br/>interpreter"| Python["Python 3.12"]
    MLflow -->|"crypto<br/>TLS/encryption"| OpenSSL["OpenSSL 3.0+<br/>(via UBI 9)"]

    %% External Dependencies (Optional - Backend Stores)
    MLflow -->|"metadata store<br/>5432/TCP"| PostgreSQL["PostgreSQL 13+<br/>(recommended)"]
